<title>GERMANY: German Econ Ministry details pan-German Q2 GDP.</title>
<headline>German Econ Ministry details pan-German Q2 GDP.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Economics Ministry gave the following qtr/qtr details for Q2 pan-German GDP. The Federal Statistics Office had earlier given the year/year figures:</p>
<p>PAN-GERMANY:		 Q2 96	 Q1 96	 Q4 95</p>
<p> Private consumption     +1.5	  +1.0(+0.5)  +0.5</p>
<p> Public consumption	+1.0	  +2.0(+1.0)  -0.5(+1.0)</p>
<p> Capital investment	unch	  +0.5(unch)  +0.5</p>
<p> Construction	     +10.5	  -9.0(-7.5)  -2.0(-2.5)</p>
<p> Inventories		 -1.5	  +0.5	  +0.5(-1.0)</p>
<p> Exports		     +1.0	  unch(-1.5)  +0.5(+3.0)</p>
<p> Imports		     -1.5	  +0.5(unch)  +1.5(+1.0)</p>
</text>
